== Overview ==
The Magnet Toilet is a small red flying toilet that can stun [[units]]. It appears in the map [[Time Factory]] in the [[Episode 73 Part 2 Update|Clock Event]].

== Appearance ==
The Magnet Toilet is a bright red toilet with helicopter blades attached to its tank. It's smiling, with its eyes covered with a metallic helmet, and a horseshoe magnet attached to its forehead.

== Strategies ==
This [[Enemies|toilet]] is really easy to defeat, you can use any high DPS unit such as the [[Clock Spider]].

Alternatively, use stun bait units such as [[Leprechaun Cameraman]] or [[Shield Cameraman]].

== Trivia ==

* This toilet is from the Dom Studio's Skibidi Toilet Multiverse fan series.
* This is the first toilet added to the game from Dom Studio's Multiverse Series

